  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/k4B832GB/images/9fac44efe5dbddd6e848320c9aa8c0ccfe186c80.png\" alt=\"Tweaks Delight\"></p>\n<p><strong>总是忘记烹饪食谱？在凌乱的箱子中很难找到食材吗？</strong> Tweaks Delight 为 Farmer's Delight 添加了许多提升生活质量的特性，让玩家更容易制作餐点、寻找食材，并快速查看他们的锅或煎锅。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tweaks-delight/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下载 26.1 更新\"></a></p>\n<h2>🍽️ 功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>只需注视物品展示框中的食物，即可立即查看其烹饪食谱。</li>\n<li>将准星悬停在锅或煎锅上，即可快速查看内部的食材以及正在烹饪的菜肴。</li>\n<li>当在箱子或背包内时，按住 Shift 键悬停在任何餐点上，高亮显示所需的精确食材，方便你在物品散落各处时轻松获取资源。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>🛠️ 兼容模组</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>所有可用的 Farmer's Delight 附属模组</li>\n<li>Fast Item Frames（快速物品展示框）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>无法与您喜爱的附属模组配合使用？<a href=\"https://github.com/axperty/tweaksdelight/issues/new\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">请告诉我</a></em>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"Saving for a laptop!\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Support Me Button\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Donate Button\"></p>",
